  "description": "ResultSetAggregateMaxMinGroupBy executions ResultSetAggregateMinMaxJoin (ordinal 3) and ResultSetAggregateMinNoGroupSelectHaving (ordinal 5): a SupportBeanString-seeded grouped min/max join over a filtered length(3) market window, followed by ungrouped new-only min HAVING over a length(5) window. No virtual time is advanced; payloads preserve the pinned SupportMarketDataBean symbol, volume (including null where relevant), and price=0 sequence.",
  "javaCommit": "9e1b9f1cc9117fea4bf33ab043762c045d73839c",
